{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A story-driven, top-down horror shooter set in a zombie-infested post-apocalypse. Visceral, grounded, and realistic. A fresh take on a classic genre.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743000/extras/bandosi_600.gif?t=1747902860\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">FEATURES</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deep Combat System </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage in tactical, skill-based combat with a wide range of options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enemy Variety</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face 8 distinct types of zombies with unique behaviors, as well as organized, well-equipped bandits. If you're clever, you can even pit them against each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Diverse Arsenal </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from 12 firearms and 6 melee weapons. A dynamic status effect system encourages creative weapon combinations and tactics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743000/extras/Horde2_600.gif?t=1747902860\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tense Atmosphere </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in a gritty world where danger lurks in every shadow, and every shot counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gripping Story </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A tale of human nature in a decaying world. Your wayward brother wants a ride to retrieve an old stash \u2014 what could possibly go wrong?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3743000?t=1747902860","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3743000?t=1747902860","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743000/13f6b49b8aeafeca8c3c7fbcea465434886d91e3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747902860","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743000/13f6b49b8aeafeca8c3c7fbcea465434886d91e3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747902860","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A story-driven, top-down horror shooter set in a zombie-infested post-apocalypse. Visceral, grounded, and realistic. A fresh take on a classic genre.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743000/extras/bandosi_600.gif?t=1747902860\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">FEATURES</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deep Combat System </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage in tactical, skill-based combat with a wide range of options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enemy Variety</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face 8 distinct types of zombies with unique behaviors, as well as organized, well-equipped bandits. If you're clever, you can even pit them against each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Diverse Arsenal </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from 12 firearms and 6 melee weapons. A dynamic status effect system encourages creative weapon combinations and tactics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743000/extras/Horde2_600.gif?t=1747902860\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tense Atmosphere </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in a gritty world where danger lurks in every shadow, and every shot counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gripping Story </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A tale of human nature in a decaying world. Your wayward brother wants a ride to retrieve an old stash \u2014 what could possibly go wrong?</p>","developers":["Ivan Onokhin","Andrew Indrikson"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3583670","name":"Where the forest ends"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743000/445d4457f34ba346a3f9c509d87c1fd194114020/header.jpg?t=1747902860","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257139095,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257139095/movie480.mp4?t=1747579895","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257139095/movie_max.mp4?t=1747579895"},"name":"Announcement trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257139095/547e3a5c5274485d12cf014fca573509ec4e93ec/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1747579895","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257139095/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1747579895","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257139095/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1747579895"}}],"name":"Where the forest ends Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</st